# Defect d-lane-blocking-small2-2 (2026-11-25): one folder written once
# absolute and once relative, or through a link, was two packages: `heroes
# add --path <abs> --as other` beside the entry naming it `../local/lib`
# wrote a second entry at exit 0, and a package whose own catalogue names its
# neighbour `../dep` was refused where the program named that folder through
# a link; and the same folder added under its own name by another spelling
# was refused as another package, to be named with `--as`. A `path` is now
# the folder on its device, never its spelling.
use <lib>/lib

function main()
    print(lib.x().to_str())
